# The story firmware with the bandwidth and weight-tier rate rows at boot
# (main.cpp bench_memory, main/bench_tiers.cpp), measured with the story's
# caches, display and PSRAM timing:
#   run_story_hardware.py --reuse-artifact --sdkconfig-extra sdkconfig.bench.defaults ...
# builds it in build_story_hw_bench, so the shipped story build never carries
# the rows. Its timings are not the story's: the binary differs.
CONFIG_ET_BENCH_MEM=y
